WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
A call starts and Tape joins it.

00:03.400 --> 00:09.600
Two languages, one transcript: Chinese and English, line for line.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.600
Records Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, and the room you are in.

00:11.600 --> 00:18.800
Your archive, in your assistant: ask in English, find it in a Mandarin meeting.

00:18.800 --> 00:22.000
It's all on Tape.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
Bilingual meeting memory. Now on Mac and web.
